The monetary step applies to total basis rather than each unit.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:Cash
account Income:Gains
