  Assets:Broker  6 FUND {{2 USD}}
  Assets:Cash  -2 USD

2024-02-01 Sale
  Assets:Broker  -3 FUND {0.33 USD} @@ 1 USD
  Assets:Cash  1 USD
  Income:Gains  -0.01 USD

